This release contains:
ArcaniA: Gothic 4
ArcaniA: Fall of Setarrif
Both releases are slip-streamed as a single title. For the PS3 and PS4 this is the first release of the game. For the Xbox 360, the original game ArcaniA: Gothic 4 was already available for the platform, but ArcaniA: Fall of Setarrif was not previously available.